#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/orcs.adoc:140
msgid ""
"If an Ogre unit can use its initiative to charge an enemy unit of humans at "
"the start of the Command phase then it must do so. This happens "
"automatically and their commander can do nothing about it. ‘Humans’ "
"encompasses all ‘men’ including Chaos Warriors and Marauders, but not "
"Dwarfs, Elves etc."
msgstr ""

