#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/beastmen.adoc:149
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/chaos.adoc:128
msgid "Dragon Ogres are immune to terror."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/beastmen.adoc:161
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/chaos.adoc:139
msgid ""
"Spawn units cause terror in combat – enemies suffer the −1 Combat modifier "
"for fighting terrifying creatures. Spawn units cannot be driven back by "
"shooting and never roll for drive backs. Spawn units must pursue or advance "
"if victorious in combat where it is permitted to do so."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/beastmen.adoc:167
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/chaos.adoc:145
msgid ""
"Spawn units have a shooting range of 15cm and 360° vision – the unit can "
"draw line of sight from all edges of its stand for the purpose of evading "
"and shooting, including shooting at charging enemies. Note that this unit "
"still needs Line of Sight from its front edge to charge an enemy."
msgstr ""

